sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Administrador
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant CTRL as UsuariosPermissoesController
  participant PG as PermissionGuard
  participant SVC as UsuariosPermissoesService
  participant AUD as AuditoriaService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  A->>FE: escolhe usuario e permissao
  FE->>CTRL: POST /usuarios-permissoes
  CTRL->>PG: exige hub.acessos.conceder
  PG-->>CTRL: admin passa por bypass
  CTRL->>SVC: create(usuarioId, permissaoId)
  SVC->>DB: insere UsuarioPermissao
  alt vinculo ja existe
    DB-->>SVC: erro P2002 (unique)
    SVC-->>FE: 409 Conflito
  else criado
    SVC->>AUD: registra permissao_concedida
    SVC-->>FE: 201
    FE-->>A: permissao concedida
  end
  Note over FE,DB: A proxima requisicao do usuario<br/>ja reflete a nova permissao:<br/>getAccess() nao usa cache
